{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"gravel-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"gravel-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["gravel-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Pumili ng isang hugis at yunit, ipasok ang mga sukat at lalim, at pagkatapos ay kalkulahin. Ang order dami ay kasama ang iyong dagdag na materyal porsyento. Timbang at bag count ay lilitaw kapag ikaw ay pumasok density at laki ng bag. Suppliers ay maaaring gumamit ng iba't ibang densities, kaya tratuhin ang timbang bilang isang pagtatantya.","record_id":"c014afc0d107adc33bd628f78b8b6c8fdb8f5a1a45a908db7473b8874e34baa0","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":1.5414528751250032,"source":"Choose a shape and unit, enter the measurements and depth, then calculate. The order volume includes your extra-material percentage. Weight and bag count appear when you enter density and bag size. Suppliers can use different densities, so treat the weight as an estimate.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"6a85c8bc915b8aa7164f3a51e3ea2eac08892cca0bd8c17bdafe14e5d7cc7131","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Pumili ng isang hugis at yunit, ipasok ang mga sukat at lalim, at pagkatapos ay kalkulahin. Ang order dami ay kasama ang iyong dagdag na materyal porsyento. Timbang at bag count ay lilitaw kapag ikaw ay pumasok density at laki ng bag. Suppliers ay maaaring gumamit ng iba't ibang densities, kaya tratuhin ang timbang bilang isang pagtatantya.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
